  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dfe88ea1446f639428eb628f6eae278e, type: 3}
  m_Name: InfoPoint3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: Something we can do to act more sustainably is to use renewable energy
      sources.
  - speaker: 
    text: 'Things like gas and coal aren''t sustainable and will run out eventually.
      Natural sources like solar or hydro can be much more sustainable and renewable. '
  - speaker: 
    text: 'You can also do your part through actions like planting trees, and giving
      back to the environment. '
